; Local refinement of the consensus `base` module. The Blueprint's copy of base.cddl (cardano-blueprint
; src/codecs/base.cddl, fe4cceb9) has this rule and is otherwise identical to ouroboros-consensus'; the
; Blueprint's LeiosFetch `bitmaps = { * base.word16 => base.word64 }` needs it.
word16 = uint .size 2
